   "en": "\"Our eyes met right now, right?\"\n\nAko Miyakomoto, a first-year high school student, accidentally put a lipstick on the clothes of Harumi Aikawa, a super hot guy. When she tries to take Harumi's clothes to the cleaners, she takes them off and is told cold-bloodedly, “Throw those clothes away.\"\nAko then witnesses Haroumi-senpai being secretly photographed by a schools girls. Then, she takes a shocking action that surprises even Harumi...?"
